  "description": "The user is projected onto the visual material of the man pointing confrontationally and the textual material 'fucking queers'. The aggressive visual tone and the offensive text create a direct projection where the user is implicitly positioned as the one delivering or embodying the hateful message. The absence of explicit deictic pronouns like 'me' or 'you' means the projection is indirect, relying on the user's identification with the hostile persona and message presented in the meme.",
